. Many questions involve a partner, children or parents, and the program can take them into account.</p></details><details><summary>Can I start with a single consultation?<span aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>Yes. You can begin with one consultation and decide about the program afterwards.</p></details><details><summary>Can I take part from outside India?<span aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>Yes. Calls and messages work across time zones. Mention yours when you enquire.</p></details><details><summary>What does the program cost?<span aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>The fee depends on the format and is shared when you enquire, before you decide.</p></details><details><summary>Does this replace medical or professional advice?<span aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>No. This is personal and spiritual guidance. It does not replace medical care, mental health treatment, legal advice or financial advice from qualified professionals.</p></details></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class="site-footer" id="site-footer"><div class="section-wrap"><div class="footer-cta-box"><div class="footer-cta-text"><h2>Start with one conversation</h2><p>Tell her team what is on your mind.</p></div><div><a href="/contact/" class="button-primary footer-cta-btn" data-enquiry="" data-source="footer" aria-haspopup="dialog"><span>Enquire about a consultation</span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="footer-content"><div class="footer-brand"><img src="/images/nng-logo-400.webp" alt="Transformation with NNG" width="160" height="84" loading="lazy"/><p><strong>Narayani Garg, The Life Strategist</strong>Mind. Direction. Alignment.</p></div><nav class="footer-nav" aria-label="Footer links"><strong class="footer-col-title">PAGES</strong><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/services/">Services</a><a href="/hand-ho